Source: ishtaria-web
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/VitexSoftware/ishtaria-web
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ishtaria-web
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: nginx | httpd, ishtaria-doc
Description: web portal of the Ishtaria virtual planet
 Static website with the introduction of Ishtaria and download
 instructions for its Debian packages, in English and Czech.
 .
 The site is installed under /usr/share/ishtaria-web/html. An example
 nginx site is provided in /etc/nginx/sites-available/ishtaria-web but
 is not enabled automatically.
